[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0497","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0497.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0452","title":"Lotus Domino Server ESMTP服务MAIL FROM缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Lotus Domino Server 5.0.1/5.0.2/5.0.3 的 ESMTP（扩展简单邮件传输协议）服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当服务器处理 SMTP 邮件传输命令时，攻击者可向目标系统的 ESMTP 服务发送包含超长 MAIL FROM 命令的恶意请求，由于服务端未对输入长度进行充分校验，导致内部缓冲区发生溢出，进而触发拒绝服务（DoS），使邮件服务崩溃或不可用。该漏洞无需认证即可远程触发，攻击条件简单（低复杂度），仅需向目标 SMTP 端口发送特制数据包即可利用。此漏洞影响 Lotus Domino Enterprise Server 及 Mail Server 5.0.1、5.0.2、5.0.3 版本，CVSS v2 评分为 5.0（中危），主要危害为可用性损失。IBM 已在后续版本中修复该问题，建议用户升级至修复后的版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0452"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:45Z","remediation":"立即升级 Lotus Domino Server 至 5.0.4 或更高版本，IBM 已在后续版本中修复了 ESMTP 服务的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如使用 5.0.1 版本，可通过 Domino 管理员控制台禁用 ESMTP 服务，或限制 SMTP 服务仅监听内部网络地址（修改 notes.ini 中的 smtpdcommands 参数）。建议在防火墙层面对 SMTP 端口（25）实施访问控制，仅允许可信 IP 段连接。长期方案应迁移到 IBM Domino 6.x 或更高版本，或 IBM Notes/Domino 8.5+ 版本以获得完整安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0219.html","http://www.osvdb.org/321","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1229","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0452.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0452","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0452.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0452.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4c68-92p7-xggr/GHSA-4c68-92p7-xggr.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0452.md","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0452.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0497.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0492","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0492.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0450","title":"Quest Software Big Brother System and Network Monitor 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Big Brother系统和网络监视器的 bbd 服务器存在代码执行漏洞，攻击者可通过向 bbd 服务发送特制请求，利用输入验证缺陷在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Big Brother System and Network Monitor 的相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于高危漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，通过网络即可远程触发，成功利用可导致系统完全被控，攻击者可完全控制受影响服务器。官方已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0450"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:45Z","remediation":"立即将 Big Brother 监控系统迁移至其维护分支 Xymon（https://www.xymon.com/），Xymon 已修复 bbd 服务的命令注入问题。如短期内无法迁移，应立即停止 bbd 服务（执行 /etc/init.d/bb stop 或 kill bbd 进程），并从防火墙层面阻断外部对 Big Brother 服务端口（默认 1984/tcp、1985/tcp）的访问，仅允许内网可信管理地址连接。同时检查系统是否被利用，在 /var/log/bb 序列日志中搜索异常命令执行记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0216.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1257","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0450.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0450","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0450.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0450.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5fqp-4gw6-3ph8/GHSA-5fqp-4gw6-3ph8.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1257/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0450.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001393.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0492.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0385","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0385.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0463","title":"Be 公司 BeOS 5.0 TCP 分片 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BeOS 5.0 操作系统 TCP 协议栈在处理分片数据包时存在安全缺陷，当接收到特制 TCP 分片报文时，系统无法正确验证其完整性和有效性，导致内核缓冲区溢出或关键处理流程异常。这种缺陷影响 BeOS 5.0 及其后续版本，支持多种平台，包括旧世代的个人电脑和工作站。由于攻击者无需任何权限即可发起攻击，只要在网络中发送精心构造的、分片过大的 TCP 数据包，即可导致系统资源耗尽，使其无法正常响应用户请求，造成持续的拒绝服务效果。这种漏洞特别危险，因为它可以通过简单的网络流量就能触发系统崩溃，攻击者可以持续向目标发送分片报文，确保系统保持不稳定状态。该漏洞的低攻击复杂度和无需身份验证的特点，进一步放大了其危害性，使其成为攻击者理想的攻击手段。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0463"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:47Z","remediation":"升级到修复了TCP分片处理漏洞的BeOS 5.1版本或更高版本（如BeOS 5.1或以后的OS后的板块）。如果无法立即升级，可通过防火墙禁用分片或使用网络ACL控制目标端口（如8080、1234）的TCP端口流量；同时确保网络安全设备支持对大型ICMP分片或TCP分片进行深度报文检查，并配置路由器或防火墙限制超过MTU的分包数量；紧急情况下，还可断开同网段机器的网络连接以遏制分片溢出攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0197.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1222","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19938","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0463.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0463","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/51d462e668438eaead0d5fabdd60f13269763472/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0463.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0463.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rh3j-mw5f-8w7p/GHSA-rh3j-mw5f-8w7p.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0463.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0385.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0375","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0375.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0453","title":"XFree86 X11r6 TCP包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"XFree86 X11R6 3.3.5/3.3.6/4.0 版本的 X 服务器在处理发送到 6000 端口的 TCP 数据包时，未正确验证数据包中的计数器字段值。远程攻击者可构造包含负数计数器值的畸形 TCP 数据包发送至目标系统的 6000 端口（X11 服务默认端口），触发整数溢出或逻辑错误导致 X 服务器崩溃，造成拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 XFree86 3.3.x 及 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击无需认证、网络可远程发起，仅影响可用性。攻击者无需认证即可远程发起攻击，利用方式为向目标主机 6000 端口发送精心构造的恶意 TCP 数据包导致 X 服务崩溃拒绝服务。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC（EDB-19950）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0453"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46Z","remediation":"升级XFree86 X11r6至CVE-2000-0453官方补丁版本（如3.3.8或更高版本），修补TCP数据包处理中的负数计数器漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙上禁用或限制访问端口6000（X11服务端口），临时缓解服务崩溃风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0223.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1235","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19950","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0453.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0453","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0453.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0453.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3vr3-fvrq-86x3/GHSA-3vr3-fvrq-86x3.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0453.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0453.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001395.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0375.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0356","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0356.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0437","title":"Gauntlet Firewall 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Gauntlet Firewall 4.1/4.2/5.0、WebShield E-ppliance 100.0/300.0 及 SGI IRIX 6.5.x 系统中使用的 CyberPatrol 守护进程 \"cyberdaemon\" 存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的网络数据包触发该溢出，导致拒绝服务或执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞利用门槛低，攻击者无需任何权限即可完全控制受影响设备。CVSS 评分为 10.0（严重），影响网络边界安全设备及 Unix 工作站。建议升级至厂商已修复的安全版本并限制相关服务的网络访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0437"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:43Z","remediation":"1. 应用 Network Associates（NAI）官方安全补丁，将 Gauntlet Firewall 升级至 5.5 之后的安全版本并重启服务。2. 对于 WebShield E-appliance 100.0/300.0，同样应用 NAI 发布的对应补丁。3. 如无法立即打补丁，在防火墙配置中移除或禁用 CyberPatrol 过滤软件的 cyberdaemon 守护进程（该组件即使未授权也可被外部网络访问），并使用 Gauntlet 的 `adminchangeproducts` 命令禁止其随系统启动。4. 对于 SGI IRIX 6.5.2–6.5.5 系统，因已停止官方支持，建议通过防火墙 ACL 规则限制外部对 8999/tcp 端口的访问，或更换受支持的操作系统版本。5. 临时缓解措施：在网络边界防火墙阻断发往防火墙管理/过滤端口的未授权流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0249.html","http://www.osvdb.org/322","http://www.pgp.com/jump/gauntlet_advisory.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1234","http://www.tis.com/support/cyberadvisory.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19949","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0437.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0437","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0437/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0437.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0437.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/G/gauntlet_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0437.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0356.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0324","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0324.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0394","title":"Axent NetProwler 3.0 畸形IP数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Axent NetProwler 3.0 入侵检测系统存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送特制的畸形 IP 数据包，触发 NetProwler 的中间人（Man-in-the-Middle）检测签名处理逻辑，导致该安全软件自身崩溃或停止响应，从而丧失入侵检测能力。该漏洞影响 NetProwler 3.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。厂商已停止支持该产品，建议用户升级至替代方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0394"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Axent NetProwler 3.0，该产品已停止维护且厂商未发布补丁。建议立即升级至 Symantec 或其他厂商仍在支持周期的入侵检测系统。如无法升级，可在 NetProwler 配置中禁用 Man-in-the-Middle 签名规则，并在网络边界防火墙添加规则丢弃异常分片 IP 数据包作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95878603510835&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1225","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=392AD3B3.3E9BE3EA%40axent.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19941","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0394.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0394","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0394.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0394.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xh9x-3wgg-3wwg/GHSA-xh9x-3wgg-3wwg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0394.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/04a9a8381d346b006d2615d73d55f4e286759f63/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0324.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1108","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0464","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4.x/5.x ActiveX 参数解析缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 版本的 ActiveX 参数解析功能存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（被称为\"畸形组件属性\"漏洞），远程攻击者可通过构造畸形的 ActiveX 组件属性参数触发缓冲区溢出，在用户访问恶意网页时无需身份认证即可在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 IE 4.x 和 5.x 所有版本，攻击向量为网络攻击，攻击复杂度较高但无需认证，成功利用可导致系统完全被攻控（机密性、完整性、可用性均完全丧失），CVSS 评分 7.6（高危）。Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS00-032 修复此漏洞，用户应升级至 IE 5.01 SP1 或更高版本并安装相应补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0464"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:47Z","remediation":"立即升级到支持此漏洞修复的现代浏览器版本（IE已停止支持，请使用Microsoft Edge、Google Chrome或Mozilla Firefox）。在Windows Update中启用重要更新，确保获取包含ActiveX安全补丁的最新安全更新。如需继续使用IE，可通过\"Internet Explorer安全增强配置\"禁用不必要的ActiveX控件并应用最新的IE11安全补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=261257","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1223","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-033","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0464.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0464","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0464.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0464.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p267-cj3r-wj88/GHSA-p267-cj3r-wj88.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0464.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0464.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--57665a78-2a4b-4eaf-984c-fcb52bc821a6.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1108.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0387","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0387.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0465","title":"微软 互联网浏览器 跨框架访问漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 系列在 DocumentComplete() 事件处理中存在跨框架访问验证漏洞。浏览器未能正确验证 iframe 所属域名，攻击者可构造恶意的跨域 iframe 通过文档完成事件读取目标用户的本地文件。该漏洞影响 Windows 系统上 IE 4.0/5.0/5.5 等版本，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害程度中危，攻击条件为网络、无身份验证。攻击者可通过嵌入恶意 iframe 诱骗受害者访问受控页面，从而非法读取浏览器缓存、Cookies 或本地文件等敏感信息，威胁用户隐私安全和数据完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0465"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:47Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-033 发布的补丁程序，受影响版本为 Internet Explorer 4.0、4.01、5.0 及 5.01，需先升级至 IE 4.01 Service Pack 2 或 IE 5.01 再安装补丁。也可升级至 Internet Explorer 5.5 或 5.01 Service Pack 1，这两个版本不受此漏洞影响。补丁已并入后续公告 MS00-055，可通过 Microsoft Update 或下载中心获取 KB 262509 补丁包进行修复。如无法立即打补丁，临时措施为禁用 Active Scripting 或避免浏览不受信任的网站，降低恶意页面通过跨框架读取本地文件的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=251108","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=255676","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1224","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-033","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19939","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0465.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0465.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0465","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0465.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0465.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rf8w-rp5f-f625/GHSA-rf8w-rp5f-f625.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0465.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0387.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0387.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0387.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0342","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0342.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0417","title":"Cayman 3220-H DSL Router 管理界面拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cayman 3220-H DSL Router 的管理接口存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 HTTP 管理界面提交超长的用户名或密码字符串，触发路由器处理异常导致服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 Cayman 3220-H DSL Router 1.0 及 GatorSurf 5.3 等版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。攻击者只需构造特制的 HTTP 请求即可实施攻击，利用门槛低，可导致路由器管理功能暂时不可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0417"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:40Z","remediation":"该设备为 2000 年发布的已停产产品，厂商不再提供安全更新。建议将设备升级至支持安全认证的替代产品；如无法替换，可在路由器管理界面中限制管理端口仅允许内网可信 IP 访问，并在上游防火墙配置规则拦截对 TCP 80/443 端口的公网访问，同时设置合理的密码长度限制避免超长字符串触发 DoS。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0075.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0280.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1219","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19923","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0417.json