],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32Z","remediation":"立即禁用 ICEcap Manager 的调试功能（debugging feature），修改所有默认用户名和密码为强密码。在防火墙上限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 ICEcap 管理端口（默认 5000/tcp）。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的替代方案（如 Microsoft System Center Operations Manager 或 SolarWinds 等现代网络监控平台）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://advice.networkice.com/advice/Support/KB/q000166/","http://www.osvdb.org/312","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1216","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2220","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19922","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0350.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0350","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0350.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0350.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3xrw-8rrf-5qr9/GHSA-3xrw-8rrf-5qr9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0350.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/icecap_default_pw.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0304.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0304.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0304.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1008","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0391","title":"MIT Kerberos 5 krshd 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Kerberos 5 中的远程 shell 服务 krshd 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的网络请求，触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Kerberos 5 相关部署环境，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0391"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 MIT Kerberos 5 至 1.2 及以上版本，该版本已修复 krshd 缓冲区溢出漏洞。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2000-025 提供的更新包。如无法升级，可在 inetd 配置中禁用 krshd 服务（注释掉 kshell 行）并重启 inetd，同时通过防火墙限制对 544 端口（krb5-shell）的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0184.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-05/0295.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-06.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4876","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1220","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0391.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0391","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0391.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0391.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r8jx-rgwf-cw4w/GHSA-r8jx-rgwf-cw4w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa